==Battleground==
*6 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*4 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 23.33 seconds<sup>700f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Kory]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Ghost Snache]]s spawn, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
**3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**10 [[Ghost Doge]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 5.33~12 seconds<sup>160f~360f</sup>.
**5 [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn after 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
**2 [[Kang Roo]]s spawn after 12 seconds<sup>360f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**3 [[Pigeon de Sable]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Ghost Baa Baa]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is mostly just Floating peon spam, so an anti-Floating area attacker like [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]] would help. As for Kory, just try to deal with him as you do usually, i.e. by using tanky units like [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Island Cat]] to damage him, the aforementioned swarm isn't going to spice the encounter up.

